Package: eq3-6-dew
Version: 3245r136
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Your Name <you@example.com>
Depends: libc6
Description: EQ3/6 DEW variant for high pressure-temperature geochemical modeling
 EQ3/6 DEW (Deep Earth Water) variant compiled from the SUPCRTandEQs/DEW_activities
 source by the ENKI portal.
 .
 Executables are installed with a 'dew-' prefix so this package coexists with
 the eq3-6 package (LLNL v8.0a) without name conflicts.
 .
 Includes five executables: dew-eqpt (DATA0 preprocessor), dew-eq3 (EQ3
 speciation), dew-eq6 (EQ6 mass transfer), dew-supcrt (SUPCRT92 thermodynamic
 calculator), dew-cprons92 (sprons converter).
 .
 Data files (DATA0, sprons93) are installed to /usr/share/eq3-6-dew/.
